# Testing conventions

- Use pytest and pytest-asyncio for all backend tests.
- Always mock third-party external API requests (e.g., payment gateways, external HTTP calls).
- Store fixtures in `tests/conftest.py`.
- When requested, run `uv run pytest` in the integrated terminal and iterate on code until all tests pass.
